# 统一换行符：所有文本文件入库为 LF、检出为 LF。
# （v1.5.0 曾误将约 60 个文件以 CRLF 提交，本文件防止再次发生。）
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 专用脚本保留 CRLF（若未来引入）
# *.bat text eol=crlf
# *.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制资产不做任何换行符处理（text=auto 通常能自动识别，此处显式声明以防误判）
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.jar binary
*.zip binary
*.apk binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mkv binary
*.webm binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.pdf binary
